{"3627540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Verses: Hyper-Kinetic Aerial Joust", "steam_appid": 3627540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627540/extras/505fe72b77b87c485bd47d50ca5b7ee8.poster.avif?t=1777092329\" aria-label=\"Titan Reaver flies and boosts forward, skimming the ground, missing an opponent, and gets sliced by a second opponent.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627540/extras/505fe72b77b87c485bd47d50ca5b7ee8.webm?t=1777092329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627540/extras/505fe72b77b87c485bd47d50ca5b7ee8.mp4?t=1777092329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strap into your Reaver and power up your Energy Blade. Verses is a Hyper-Kinetic fusion of aerial jousting &amp; high speed racing. This competitive sport is an easy to learn, fluid moving, explosive arcade battle for 1-4 players. Fly into a visionary future on courses scattered across the solar system.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explosive Future Sport</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627540/extras/bc1dd5fc080e8e947201cb4dec375346.poster.avif?t=1777092329\" aria-label=\"Mimas Reaver flies through an active explosion in slow motion, blade extended. Slow-motion ends and the Reaver retracts its blade.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627540/extras/bc1dd5fc080e8e947201cb4dec375346.webm?t=1777092329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627540/extras/bc1dd5fc080e8e947201cb4dec375346.mp4?t=1777092329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Part racing, part fighting, all action. Verses is  unlike any sport that's come before, filled with deadly spacecrafts, intense battles, and explosive victories. Wield your Energy Blade with  killer intent to destroy your opponents. Make incredible plays that feel awesome and get the crowd roaring.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Blazing Fast Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627540/extras/3969f00206bdbf10bee1b50ed93edad4.poster.avif?t=1777092329\" aria-label=\"Titan Reaver spins and jousts with two Venus Reavers. Titan is hit and explodes in slow motion, a burst of light making radiant effects and flares.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627540/extras/3969f00206bdbf10bee1b50ed93edad4.webm?t=1777092329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627540/extras/3969f00206bdbf10bee1b50ed93edad4.mp4?t=1777092329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly at breakneck speeds to fight up close in head-on collision battles. Make the right plays and joust with deadly precision to survive razor-thin close calls; or don't survive at all.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hyper-Kinetic Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627540/extras/d9e4c207ef7866469d0bbcdb7d083fc2.poster.avif?t=1777092329\" aria-label=\"Mimas Reaver gracefully flies and spins around a turn.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627540/extras/d9e4c207ef7866469d0bbcdb7d083fc2.webm?t=1777092329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627540/extras/d9e4c207ef7866469d0bbcdb7d083fc2.mp4?t=1777092329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The unique Hyper-Kinetic system converts movement into power. Soar through beautiful courses with high speed 3D steering, boosting, drifting, spinning, and more maneuvers to charge your abilities and take the upper-hand.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play with Friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627540/extras/d3b97609836be403f563249d7183654b.poster.avif?t=1777092329\" aria-label=\"Neptune Reaver with its ally ahead jousts against two Mimas Reavers. One Reaver up ahead is destroyed in slow motion. The two near-camera Reavers joust and miss.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627540/extras/d3b97609836be403f563249d7183654b.webm?t=1777092329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627540/extras/d3b97609836be403f563249d7183654b.mp4?t=1777092329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Verses is made for competitive and co-op multiplayer with local split-screen (and Steam Remote Play Together). Go head-to-head in a 1-on-1 grudge match or team up for 2-on-2 battles against friends, frenemies or bots.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight with Skill and Style</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627540/extras/6fc356cecdce855225515406c18e1a62.poster.avif?t=1777092329\" aria-label=\"Titan Reaver clashes energy blades with an opponent. The Titan Reaver gets part of its wing chopped off in the joust.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627540/extras/6fc356cecdce855225515406c18e1a62.webm?t=1777092329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627540/extras/6fc356cecdce855225515406c18e1a62.mp4?t=1777092329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outwit and outplay your opponents with head games, feints, dodges, and surprise attacks in intense joust rhythms. Test your mettle and your skills with teamwork, nuanced plays, precise attacks, and narrow escapes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Give 'em a Show</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627540/extras/84843fa5a6ef01ef8721c730fdaf55b2.poster.avif?t=1777092329\" aria-label=\"Mimas Reaver missing its left wing jousts with a Neptune Reaver. Both Reavers miss with their blades but collide physically, scraping of each other.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627540/extras/84843fa5a6ef01ef8721c730fdaf55b2.webm?t=1777092329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627540/extras/84843fa5a6ef01ef8721c730fdaf55b2.mp4?t=1777092329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a spectator sport, Verses is designed with the audience experience in mind. A dedicated Spectator Mode presents the game like a sports broadcast, allowing your friends and livestream viewers  to easily follow every close call and narrow escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627540/extras/b54d3512fa6efcf9b9671ec5f4736b11.avif?t=1777092329\" alt=\"Game logo &amp;quot;Hyper-Kinetic Aerial Joust VERSES&amp;quot; accented by a Neptune Reaver\" width=1560 height=588 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627540/extras/505fe72b77b87c485bd47d50ca5b7ee8.poster.avif?t=1777092329\" aria-label=\"Titan Reaver flies and boosts forward, skimming the ground, missing an opponent, and gets sliced by a second opponent.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627540/extras/505fe72b77b87c485bd47d50ca5b7ee8.webm?t=1777092329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627540/extras/505fe72b77b87c485bd47d50ca5b7ee8.mp4?t=1777092329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strap into your Reaver and power up your Energy Blade. Verses is a Hyper-Kinetic fusion of aerial jousting &amp; high speed racing. This competitive sport is an easy to learn, fluid moving, explosive arcade battle for 1-4 players. Fly into a visionary future on courses scattered across the solar system.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explosive Future Sport</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627540/extras/bc1dd5fc080e8e947201cb4dec375346.poster.avif?t=1777092329\" aria-label=\"Mimas Reaver flies through an active explosion in slow motion, blade extended. Slow-motion ends and the Reaver retracts its blade.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com